	(footprint "ESD:LCD_16x4_Samsung_87x60_Header1x14"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "d51a8b43-eef0-41ef-a6cb-5d70d4d17806")
		(at 65 110.5)
		(descr "Samsung 16x4 HD44780-type character LCD (Lab 4 kit module; SMC1640A family), no backlight, 14-pin single-row header. Outline 87.0 x 60.0, holes 82.0 x 55.0 (2.5 mm in), pin 1 at 10.0 mm from left / 2.5 mm from top, pitch 2.54. Geometry per Vishay LCD-016N004A standard, confirmed within about 0.5 mm from a photo of the module (2026-10-20). Origin = pad 1. Courtyard covers only the header and standoffs: parts under the module must be lower than the standoff height (use >= 15 mm M2.5 standoffs and a matching tall header). NPTH 2.7 for M2.5. VERIFY with a ruler before fab.")
